":"6222cfe4-6d05-4c00-a699-d22359dd3d08","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですねー。まぁこれは単に気持ちの問題なので、どうでもいいと言えばどうでもいいんですが。","ts":"1618993669.157900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"miv7k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9D280F82-E5B2-4749-B615-3EAACD78B1C2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"感覚としては、GitHub Orgでリポジトリ作成する権限があれば、誰でも好きにリポジトリ作って良いという認識で、もしダメなら権限を適切に絞るべきって考えですね。\nSlackはフリーだと制限できない以上、自由にチャンネルを作っても構わないと思うしかないと思います。","ts":"1618993503.157700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R6+Rd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"580A0650-CDCB-433C-9B80-7F678AF19CF8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕はチャンネルはアナウンスなしで増えるのが普通という印象ですね。\n理由は、機能として誰でも作れて、アナウンスする義務もないからです。","ts":"1618993282.154000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tpwf6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"840430f9-dc6c-4b2d-9f73-e7232ed1cd96","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"コミュニティ運営難しい。。","ts":"1618992332.151400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TzGDq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dc5e51f-38c8-4fcc-abdf-43f1f2351012","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"emacs-jp、知らない間にチャンネル増えてて草。\ngeneralにも何もコメントなしで追加されてたから認知できなかった。","ts":"1618992224.151200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wXF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d30f971-0b6e-4b0b-9341-c86cb5fe249d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"やっぱり構文弄る系はLispぽさがあって面白い。(読みやすいとは限らない)","ts":"1618968203.150800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PS1X4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48a7c5fd-4383-4d18-b840-df4c6f2979fc","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"letをスレッディングマクロ内で作ることはまぁないけど、試したら動くようです。\n```(ppp-macroexpand-all\n (-\u0026gt;\u0026gt; (h)\n     (if (f) (g))\n     (let ((d (e))))\n     (if (b) (c))\n     (save-excursion)\n     (let ((a 1)))))\n;;=\u0026gt; (let ((a 1))\n;;     (save-excursion\n;;       (if (b)\n;;           (c)\n;;         (let ((d (e)))\n;;           (if (f)\n;;               (g)\n;;             (h))))))```\nスレッディングマクロはdash。\n\u003chttps://github.com/magnars/dash.el\u003e","ts":"1618968115.150500","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: magnars/dash.el","id":1,"title":"magnars/dash.el","title_link":"https://github.com/magnars/dash.el","text":"A modern list library for Emacs. Contribute to magnars/dash.el development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/73e726dbf3e01499ed8325bd29c6841a79f352c5c93b77935bb2ebf149b3499b/magnars/dash.el","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/magnars/dash.el","original_url":"https://github.com/magnars/dash.el"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SfKKe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"474f2597-02f5-48c3-a8c5-e55750e70455","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"pppはこれです \u003chttps://github.com/conao3/ppp.el\u003e","ts":"1618967494.150100","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: conao3/ppp.el","id":1,"title":"conao3/ppp.el","title_link":"https://github.com/conao3/ppp.el","text":"Extended pretty printer for Emacs Lisp. Contribute to conao3/ppp.el development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/b8acfdf3693f58875cc0bc6ece14788260798b40eee796eeefd79c75f1bc5054/conao3/ppp.el","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/conao3/ppp.el","original_url":"https://github.com/conao3/ppp.el"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+VH7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d91255d-e23d-4d16-9570-3a216a362906","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"スレッディングマクロぽさはありますね。\n```(ppp-macroexpand\n (progn!\n  let ((a 1))\n  save-excursion\n  if (b) (c)\n  let ((d (e)))\n  if (f) (g)\n  (h)))\n;;=\u0026gt; (progn\n;;     (let ((a 1))\n;;       (save-excursion\n;;         (if (b)\n;;             (c)\n;;           (let ((d (e)))\n;;             (if (f)\n;;                 (g)\n;;               (h)))))))```\n","ts":"1618967408.149900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EBeN2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ae2b371-4bb7-4a6a-b6a0-5d9397241dcb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"おー。すごい!\nなんか仕様が揺れてる気がしたんで寝ちゃいました。","ts":"1618967241.149700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ls7/"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003c@U03C71D7H\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618964749.149500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"UA1GWETAA","text":"\u003c@UA1GWETAA\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618960812.149200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
